      "documentUrl": "https://info.sonicretro.org/images/1/15/Sonic1_MD_EU_manual.pdf",
      "observations": [
        "The extracted original cover is a 1940 by 1102 pixel landscape raster.",
        "The modeled booklet preserves that landscape aspect while storing the long edge along the case height."
